  "title": "New England Clam Chowder II",
  "description": "Bottled clam juice is the secret ingredient for this extra-flavorful chowder. Otherwise, this is a fairly standard chowder recipe with lots of potatoes, bacon, and onions.",
  "authors": [
    "chief2"
  ],
